      "proposed_resolution": "Classified as CAVEAT with subtype 'misconception' because the text explicitly frames it around addressing a common student error/confusion ('The Big Confusion', 'Students often ask...')."
    },
    {
      "unit_ids": [
        "u7"
      ],
      "issue": "In Unit u7, the 'travel agent' analogy could be separated into an ANALOGY unit, and the 'Summary Cheat Sheet' into a STUDY_SUPPORT (recap) unit, rather than keeping the entire section as a single CONCEPT unit.",
      "proposed_resolution": "Kept together as a single CONCEPT unit because the travel agent metaphor and cheat sheet directly support the primary teaching goal of defining and explaining oxidizing and reducing agents within one continuous episode."
    },
